    "Owner acoustic acceptance remains false. Ready sockets, source hashes and isolated synthetic audio do not prove how the physical conversation feels.",
    "Core greeting probe still took6.415s including2.977s memory and3.438s model. Removing the extra preparation prevents its proven regression but does not solve remaining response latency.",
