    "Fidelity compares normalized word order, ignoring punctuation and symbols. It cannot verify acoustics or undo already streamed speech. No buffering/retry or hidden duplicate response added.",
    "Core outage longer than the valid work lease still closes the session. No authority lease weakened, automatic mic reactivation introduced, or firmware wake-recovery claim made.",
    "Native echo guard remains half-duplex; ordinary speech over Eva is still unavailable. Separate wake/STOP/MUTE behavior retained.",
